      "source": [
        "## Code 20 — Model reshape\n",
        "\n",
        "Se transforman los arreglos de entrenamiento a dos dimensiones."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "a59267a2",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "a59267a2"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "x_train = x_train.reshape(-1, 1)\n",
        "y_train = y_train.reshape(-1, 1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "535aebde",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "535aebde"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Code 21 — Shapes\n",
        "\n",
        "Se muestran las dimensiones después del `reshape`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "0d0e021e",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0d0e021e"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "x_train.shape, y_train.shape\n",
        "# ((160, 1), (160, 1))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "2de9d478",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2de9d478"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Code 22 — LinearRegression model\n",
        "\n",
        "Se crea y entrena el modelo con `LinearRegression` y `fit()`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "1bf9b2ac",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1bf9b2ac"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n",
        "\n",
        "model = LinearRegression()\n",
        "model.fit(x_train, y_train)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "3694bce2",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3694bce2"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Code 23 — Coefficient and intercept\n",
        "\n",
        "Se muestran el coeficiente y el intercepto del modelo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "c2bcaef1",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "c2bcaef1"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "model.coef_, model.intercept_\n",
        "# 0.04652973, 7.11963843"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "18e5fdb9",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "18e5fdb9"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Code 24 — Compute loss\n",
        "\n",
        "Se predice sobre el conjunto de entrenamiento y se calcula el MSE."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "65be80c4",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "65be80c4"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Compute the predicted values\n",
        "y_pred = model.predict(x_train)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Compute the loss (mean squared error)\n",
        "loss = np.mean((y_train - y_pred) ** 2)\n",
        "print(loss)  # 10.60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "78bb1587",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "78bb1587"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Code 25 — Plot Hypothesis function\n",
        "\n",
        "Se dibuja la función hipótesis utilizando los valores mostrados en el artículo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "43200a86",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "43200a86"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "plt.scatter(x_train, y_train);\n",
        "\n",
        "x = np.linspace(0, 300, 100)\n",
        "\n",
        "b0 = 7.11\n",
        "b1 = 0.04\n",
        "\n",
        "y_hat = b0 + b1*x\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.plot(x, y_hat, 'r',  label=f'b0 = {b0},  b1 = {b1}');\n",
        "plt.legend()"
      ]
    },
